---
import { ChevronDown } from "lucide-react";
import A from "../components/A.astro";
import Section from "../components/Section.astro";
---

<Section id="news" title="Latest News">
  <ol class="divide-y divide-hairline border-y border-hairline">
    <li class="grid gap-1 py-5 sm:grid-cols-[160px_minmax(0,1fr)] sm:gap-8">
      <p class="t-meta flex items-center gap-2 sm:pt-1">
        November 2026
        <span class="chip"><span class="pulse-dot inline-block h-1 w-1 rounded-full bg-accent"></span>New</span>
      </p>
      <p class="text-gray-700 leading-relaxed">
        The <A href="https://arxiv.org/abs/2611.02102">NorthCUA</A> technical report is out, and the NorthCUA <strong class="font-semibold text-gray-900">Nano / Mini / Pro</strong>
        models are open on <A href="https://huggingface.co/beipo-ai">Hugging Face</A>
      </p>
    </li>
    <li class="grid gap-1 py-5 sm:grid-cols-[160px_minmax(0,1fr)] sm:gap-8">
      <p class="t-meta sm:pt-1">2026</p>
      <p class="text-gray-700 leading-relaxed">
        Papers accepted at <strong class="font-semibold text-gray-900">NeurIPS 2026</strong>, <strong class="font-semibold text-gray-900">EMNLP 2026</strong> (main and Findings), <strong class="font-semibold text-gray-900">CIKM 2026</strong>,
        <strong class="font-semibold text-gray-900">ICLR 2026</strong> (×2), <strong class="font-semibold text-gray-900">Findings of ACL 2026</strong>, <strong class="font-semibold text-gray-900">FSE 2026</strong> and <strong class="font-semibold text-gray-900">TOSEM</strong>, and
        <strong class="font-semibold text-gray-900">UFO²</strong> in <strong class="font-semibold text-gray-900">TMLR</strong>.
      </p>
    </li>
    <li class="grid gap-1 py-5 sm:grid-cols-[160px_minmax(0,1fr)] sm:gap-8">
      <p class="t-meta sm:pt-1">February 2026</p>
      <p class="text-gray-700 leading-relaxed">Joined <strong class="font-semibold text-gray-900">Beipo</strong> as Head of Computer-Using Agents to build NorthCUA.</p>
    </li>
    <li class="grid gap-1 py-5 sm:grid-cols-[160px_minmax(0,1fr)] sm:gap-8">
      <p class="t-meta sm:pt-1">December 2025</p>
      <p class="text-gray-700 leading-relaxed">
        <A href="https://arxiv.org/abs/2511.11332">UFO³: Weaving the Digital Agent Galaxy</A> is reported by
        <A href="https://www.jiqizhixin.com/articles/2025-12-03-7">机器之心</A>
      </p>
    </li>
    <li class="grid gap-1 py-5 sm:grid-cols-[160px_minmax(0,1fr)] sm:gap-8">
      <p class="t-meta sm:pt-1">2025</p>
      <p class="text-gray-700 leading-relaxed">
        Our book <strong class="font-semibold text-gray-900">大语言模型 GUI 智能体：人机交互新时代</strong>, the first book that systematically introduces GUI agents, is published by
        Publishing House of Electronics Industry
      </p>
    </li>
  </ol>

  <details class="group mt-0">
    <summary
      class="mt-5 inline-flex min-h-[44px] items-center gap-1.5 rounded-lg border border-hairline bg-white px-4 text-sm font-medium whitespace-nowrap text-gray-600 transition hover:border-accent hover:text-accent-ink"
    >
      <span class="group-open:hidden">Show 5 earlier updates</span>
      <span class="hidden group-open:inline">Show less</span>
      <ChevronDown size={16} className="transition-transform duration-300 group-open:rotate-180" />
    </summary>
    <ol class="mt-5 divide-y divide-hairline border-y border-hairline">
      <li class="grid gap-1 py-5 sm:grid-cols-[160px_minmax(0,1fr)] sm:gap-8">
        <p class="t-meta sm:pt-1">September 2025</p>
        <p class="text-gray-700 leading-relaxed">Two papers accepted at <strong class="font-semibold text-gray-900">NeurIPS 2025</strong> and one paper accepted at <strong class="font-semibold text-gray-900">ASE 2025</strong>.</p>
      </li>
      <li class="grid gap-1 py-5 sm:grid-cols-[160px_minmax(0,1fr)] sm:gap-8">
        <p class="t-meta sm:pt-1">May 2025</p>
        <p class="text-gray-700 leading-relaxed">One paper accepted at <strong class="font-semibold text-gray-900">ACL 2025</strong>, and one paper accepted at <strong class="font-semibold text-gray-900">KDD ADS 2025</strong>.</p>
      </li>
      <li class="grid gap-1 py-5 sm:grid-cols-[160px_minmax(0,1fr)] sm:gap-8">
        <p class="t-meta sm:pt-1">January 2025</p>
        <p class="text-gray-700 leading-relaxed">Two papers accepted at <strong class="font-semibold text-gray-900">ICLR 2025</strong> and one paper accepted at <strong class="font-semibold text-gray-900">NAACL 2025</strong>.</p>
      </li>
      <li class="grid gap-1 py-5 sm:grid-cols-[160px_minmax(0,1fr)] sm:gap-8">
        <p class="t-meta sm:pt-1">January 2025</p>
        <p class="text-gray-700 leading-relaxed">
          Our work on <A href="https://arxiv.org/pdf/2412.10047">Large Action Models</A> is released and has been reported by
          <A href="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/6FHrOMXTCUmKS2GrWrzzrA">机器之心</A> and <A href="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/BVFV8v6KGcpKoz_TYdBdAA">新智元</A>
        </p>
      </li>
      <li class="grid gap-1 py-5 sm:grid-cols-[160px_minmax(0,1fr)] sm:gap-8">
        <p class="t-meta sm:pt-1">November 2024</p>
        <p class="text-gray-700 leading-relaxed">
          Our <A href="https://arxiv.org/pdf/2411.18279">survey</A> on Large Language Model-Brained <strong class="font-semibold text-gray-900">GUI Agents</strong> is released, and it
          is reported by <A href="https://baijiahao.baidu.com/s?id=1820751448950288867&wfr=spider&for=pc">机器之心</A>
        </p>
      </li>
    </ol>
  </details>
</Section>
